 ½ in)","w":"100 kg (15 st 10 lb; 220","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/tvvttx1452926277.jpg","bio":"Scott Spedding (born 4 May 1986, Krugersdorp, South Africa) is a French rugby union player. His position is fullback and he currently plays for Clermont in the Top 14. In January 2015 he was named in the France 31-man squad for the 2015 Six Nations Championship by coach Philippe Saint-André. He made his debut for France on 8 November 2014 against Fiji."},{"id":"34182841","n":"Sébastien Bézy","pos":"Scrum-half","nat":"France","born":"1991-11-22","h":"1.74 m","w":"78 kg","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/gbagxx1623705614.jpg"},{"id":"34160843","n":"Sébastien Vahaamahina","pos":"Second Row","nat":"France","born":"1991-10-21","h":"2.03 m","w":"127 kg","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/7tajqb1623705586.jpg"},{"id":"34261098","n":"Théo Giral","pos":"Fly-half","nat":"France","born":"2003-02-04","h":"1.79 m","w":"85 kg"},{"id":"34261090","n":"Thibaud Lanen","pos":"Lock","nat":"France","born":"1998-04-01","h":"1.98 m","w":"110 kg","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/8ai3fb1756825477.jpg"},{"id":"34261091","n":"Thomas Ceyte","pos":"Lock","nat":"France","born":"1991-02-13","h":"1.98 m","w":"120 kg","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/yrzryn1756825619.jpg"},{"id":"34160836","n":"Thomas Domingo","pos":"Prop","nat":"France","born":"1985-10-20","img":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/player/thumb/lvyf3l1623715207.jpg"},{"id":"34261086","n":"Thomas Duchêne","pos":"Prop","nat":"France","born":"2004-08-25","h":"1.80 m","w":"125 kg"},{"id":"34261105","n":"Tom Belkessa","pos":"Hooker","nat":"France","born":"2006-07-28","h":"1.70 m","w":"98 kg"},{"id":"34261110","n":"Víctor Ofojetu","pos":"Back row","nat":"Spain","born":"2005-01-16","h":"1.92 m","w":"96 kg"},{"id":"34160847","n":"Viktor Kolelishvili","pos":"Flanker","nat":"Georgia","born":"1989-10-09","img